# Checkpoint blobs: reproducible outputs (same commit, same pinned corpus, same
# seeds => the same bytes). The repository carries results/checkpoints/MANIFEST.json
# (the digests, the arm, the seed, the steps, the held-out loss) instead of
# ~120 MB of float32 weights.
results/checkpoints/*.pt
